   <media:title>Welcome to UCF Space Week 2026</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/svOV_FEzVA4?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/svOV_FEzVA4/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Landing humans on the moon was just a dream when UCF was founded in 1963. But we dared to believe — developing the talent and inventing the technologies to make it reality.
 
That same spirit still drives us today. And we celebrate UCF Space Week Oct. 25-30, 2026, to honor our origin as we dare to build what’s next.

https://www.ucf.edu/spaceweek/</media:description>
